State: +
  Note:
  This directory is the testing knowledge
  base. It defines test types, levels, gates, and principles. Project-specific
  test state (coverage, runs, failures) lives in @projects/{project_name}/testing/.
  Test execution scripts live in @scripts/ and are invoked by AI or CI.

